('0241590001', '0241590', 'Matt black SF regular fit blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in woven fabric with narrow notch lapels, a decorative buttonhole and two buttons down the front. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and two inner pockets. Decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Lined. Regular fit – a classic fit with good room for movement over the shoulders and chest, which combined with a gently shaped waist creates a comfortable, tailored silhouette. For the matching trousers, search on 0391772.', NULL, 0, 0),
