('0497193004', '0497193', 'SB Timm parka', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Kids Boy Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded parka with a lined, faux-fur trimmed hood and a zip with a wind flap and press-studs down the front. Handwarmer pockets, flap front pockets and a small zipped pocket on each sleeve. Inner ribbing at the cuffs. Quilted lining.', NULL, 0, 0);
