('0501501001', '0501501', 'MOUNTAIN TR FUNC', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Other Pink', 'Bright', 'Kids Girl Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded outdoor trousers in windproof, water-repellent functional fabric with reinforced hems and back . Adjustable elastic braces and a zip fly and press-stud. Elasticated hems, a reinforced elastic strap under the feet and a reflective strip on one leg. Lined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
