('0501568006', '0501568', 'Sane bomber', 'Jacket', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Dark Yellow', 'Dark', 'Jacket Smart', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Mens Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Padded bomber jacket in Oxford-weave nylon with a small stand-up collar, and zip and button band with concealed press-studs down the front. Zipped sleeve pocket and side pockets, and one inner pocket with a press-stud. Ribbing at the cuffs and hem. Lined.', NULL, 0, 0),
