('0503642001', '0503642', 'Anna belted dress', 'Dress', 'Garment Full body', 'Dot', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Woven Tops', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Mama', 'Blouses', 'Knee-length dress in a patterned weave with a V-neck and gathers at the shoulders. 3/4-length sleeves, a narrow elasticated seam at the waist and a detachable tie-belt. Unlined.', NULL, 0, 0),
