('0503679002', '0503679', 'Monaco', 'Blouse', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Light Grey', 'Dusty Light', 'Blouse', 'Ladieswear', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Tailoring', 'Blouses', 'Blouse in woven fabric with a small stand-up collar, opening with buttons at the back of the neck and a lace yoke at the front. Short double-frilled sleeves and a rounded hem. Slightly longer at the back. The polyester content of the blouse is partly recycled.', NULL, 0, 0),
