('0504335001', '0504335', 'Seven Suit Blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Melange', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Blazer', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Two-button jacket in a slub linen and wool weave with narrow notch lapels. Chest pocket, welt front pockets with a flap and three inner pockets, one with a button. Imitation suede elbow patches, decorative buttons at the cuffs and a single back vent. Partly lined. Slim fit that tapers at the chest and waist, which combined with slightly narrower sleeves creates a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
